items.headline:
Theyab bin Mohamed bin Zayed has witnessed the signing of a partnership between 
@adafsa_gov
 and the Abu Dhabi Nature Academy to build a specialised national ecosystem for nature, wildlife and biosecurity through scientific and applied programmes tailored to priority sectors.

In the presence of Theyab bin Mohamed bin Zayed, 
@adafsa_gov
 has partnered with the Abu Dhabi Nature Academy, part of Ekthar Wildlife Development Company, a subsidiary of Erth Zayed Philanthropies, to launch the Poultry Farm Biosecurity Programme.
